<speak>I use both. The reminder goes into my electronic calendar, but I still like a physical notebook during a call. It helps me slow down. I do not try to write every word; I just need a place for my questions and ordinary follow-up reminders. Afterwards I put the notebook away rather than leave it open on the table. That was another change from the household sorting. A clear table makes it much easier to notice when something has been left there.</speak>